                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Yey my first game! I have read about Memoir En Code on the web. I'm not really a \"gamer\" and I was interested in the concept behind the game so I bought it. \n\nThe game is fairly short, but this to me is a positive thing since I don't have much time. After playing the game I get the impression that there is a lot more to find and there are some secrets that I still don't fully understand (I didn't figure out how \"DEC\" works). I'll give it another shot maybe next week.\n\nBut in general I found this game very personal and I really liked that. I think it has to be very difficult for someone to be so open about specific parts of your own life, so I think this is a very brave effort in that direction.",
